**Current Architecture of AI-Assisted Forex Trading Platform (MERN + fal.ai Vision Pipeline)**  
**Product/Tech Lead Design Document – Final Production-Ready Version**  
**Version 1.0 | Built by MERN Stack | As of October 2026**

This is the **complete, production-grade architecture** that incorporates every single capability from our entire brainstorming session:

- Guided Strategy Builder (primary method)  
- Strategy Vision Pipeline powered by fal.ai (OpenRouter Vision + NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super VL / Nemotron 3 Nano Omni Vision)  
- Step-by-step images + explanations (or video + hybrid)  
- AI chart analysis, pattern detection (BOS/CHoCH, order blocks, etc.), level extraction  
- Automatic Risk:Reward plotting, entry/exit/SL/TP boxes, structure labels on live charts  
- Full demo + live trading (separate broker accounts)  
- Automatic pair selection with edge ranking  
- Strict risk management, economic calendar filters, psychology-style guards  
- Continuous learning & gated self-improvement  
- Trade journal, backtesting, walk-forward testing  
- Performance analytics, equity curves  
- Real-time notifications (Telegram, Discord, email, in-app)  
- TradingView Lightweight Charts with full RR overlays and notify owner  
- All promotion gates (70%+ win rate NOT required — expectancy + drawdown focus)  
- Human-in-the-loop mandatory review at every critical step  
- Audit logs, kill switch, global risk limits  

The system is deliberately **not** a black-box profit machine. It is a disciplined assistant that maximizes positive expectancy while keeping losses minimal through structure, risk controls, and human oversight.

